            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a strict job-matching and relevance evaluation assistant.\nYour task is to evaluate whether a candidate is a reasonable fit for a job description based only on the provided resume and job description."
            },
            {
              "content": "=## Overview\nYou are evaluating whether a candidate is a good match for a job description.\n\nYour task is to strictly assess fit based ONLY on:\n- the CV provided\n- the job description provided\n\nDo not infer missing experience or assume skills.\n\n## Matching Rules\nReturn TRUE only if:\n- The candidate clearly matches at least 70% of required skills OR\n- Has direct equivalent experience in a similar role and industry AND\n- Seniority level is appropriate\n\nReturn FALSE if:\n- Key required skills are missing\n- Experience is unrelated or too generic\n- Seniority mismatch (e.g. junior vs senior role)\n- Evidence of alignment is weak or unclear\n\n## Context\n\n### CV\n{{ $json.content }}\n\n### Job Description\n{{ $('Job Listings Extract').item.json.descriptionText }}\n\n## Output Format (STRICT)\nReturn ONLY valid JSON. No explanations, no text.\n\n{\n  \"verdict\": true\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {
          "textFormat": {
            "textOptions": {
              "type": "json_object"
            }
          }
        }
      },
