              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are a professional resume writing assistant.\nYour task is to CV and tailor CV to match a job description while maintaining accuracy and realism.\nDo not fabricate experience or skills that are not supported by the original CV."
            },
            {
              "content": "=## Task\nYou are given a resume and a job description.\n\nYour task is to tailor the resume so it is strongly aligned with the job description while remaining truthful and accurate.\n\n## Job Description\n{{ $('Job Listings Extract').item.json.descriptionText }}\n\n## Original CV\n{{ $('Retrieve CV').item.json.content }}\n\n## Output Requirements\n- Output ONLY the updated resume\n- Format strictly in HTML for Google Docs\n- Do not include any explanations or extra text\n- Do not use markdown or backticks\n- Must start with <html> and end with </html>"
            }
